{"4465270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Junk Rush", "steam_appid": 4465270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>ROADMAP - 10,000 Wishlist!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/3bcaf1e7a07939fbd017378c542a6f67.avif?t=1783964832\" width=813 height=537 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO TA'AROA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/23861d70360736802d1e652ed294a8f4.poster.avif?t=1783964832\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/23861d70360736802d1e652ed294a8f4.webm?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/23861d70360736802d1e652ed294a8f4.mp4?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/89685e2e9b88ec48cc0f3e4120c7ebd2.avif?t=1783964832\" width=1339 height=949 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>corrupt</strong> and <strong>hostile</strong> <u>paradise archipelago</u> dominated by a local <strong>mafia</strong>! Your mission is simple:<br><strong>Pay your vig and live another day!</strong><br> You have <strong>28 days</strong> and each day of your week you'll have to be <u>strategic</u> because <strong>time flies</strong>, so be careful this archipelago is <strong>more chaotic</strong> than anything you've <strong>ever experienced</strong>, a <u>lawless land</u>. <br> Who knows, may you discover <strong>some alternative way</strong> to pay off this vig.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/a28034f49ce3063eadc3c1d2a5971e77.poster.avif?t=1783964832\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/a28034f49ce3063eadc3c1d2a5971e77.webm?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/a28034f49ce3063eadc3c1d2a5971e77.mp4?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Junk Rush</strong> is a game about making <u>hotdogs</u> and nothing else! The big difference is that we give you <strong>free will</strong>, so if during your week you find it more interesting to <u>explore the island</u>, <u>cause an apocalypse</u>, <u>poison hotdogs</u>, or even <u>practice black magic</u> with wieners, <u>you're in charge!</u> <br><br><strong>The story is ours, but the rules are yours!</strong><br><br> You'll face various <strong>challenges</strong> based on your choices that will affect your progress in the game, so be careful with your decisions to stay off the <u>police radar</u> while making sure you don't miss <strong>paying your vig</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Search</u> for <strong>new ingredients</strong> to make your hotdog <strong>better</strong> and <strong>more profitable</strong>, where <strong>each</strong> ingredient <u>can</u> have <strong>unique effects</strong> making your hotdog a <strong>masterpiece</strong> or simply something that should be classified as a <strong>biological weapon</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/897cc734978ca8522b47fe6942c903d7.poster.avif?t=1783964832\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/897cc734978ca8522b47fe6942c903d7.webm?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/897cc734978ca8522b47fe6942c903d7.mp4?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Embark on this <strong>comically acerbic adventure</strong>, where one wrong step can easily lead to <u>extreme chaos</u>, where the laws of nature cease to apply!<br>And last but not least, <strong>don't drug your Goblin</strong>, you never know what <u>unexpected</u> results might occur! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AI DISCLAIMER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/0963208353e59f6f3376e05572b489f1.poster.avif?t=1783964832\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/0963208353e59f6f3376e05572b489f1.webm?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/0963208353e59f6f3376e05572b489f1.mp4?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AI Suno</strong> was used in the project to bring our <strong>simple melodies that we composed</strong> to life because, as a <u>small indie group <strong>without</strong> much funding</u>, we can't hire many artists as <strong>we would like</strong>. But if you want to <strong>help us</strong> on this journey, you can add it to your <strong>wishlist</strong> and <strong>share</strong> the game so that on <u>launch day</u> we can have a big party and allow more artists to show their art to the world!<br> However, we want to make it clear that <u><strong>we are committed to originality</strong></u> and our ability to develop the project without the use of <strong>AI</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><strong>We don't like it, but for now it's our solution!</strong><br><br><br><br></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO TA'AROA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/23861d70360736802d1e652ed294a8f4.poster.avif?t=1783964832\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/23861d70360736802d1e652ed294a8f4.webm?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/23861d70360736802d1e652ed294a8f4.mp4?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/89685e2e9b88ec48cc0f3e4120c7ebd2.avif?t=1783964832\