ased on your choices that will affect your progress in the game, so be careful with your decisions to stay off the <u>police radar</u> while making sure you don't miss <strong>paying your vig</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Search</u> for <strong>new ingredients</strong> to make your hotdog <strong>better</strong> and <strong>more profitable</strong>, where <strong>each</strong> ingredient <u>can</u> have <strong>unique effects</strong> making your hotdog a <strong>masterpiece</strong> or simply something that should be classified as a <strong>biological weapon</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/897cc734978ca8522b47fe6942c903d7.poster.avif?t=1783964832\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/897cc734978ca8522b47fe6942c903d7.webm?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465270/extras/897cc734978ca8522b47fe6942c903d7.mp4?t=1783964832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Embark on this <strong>comically acerbic adventure</strong>, where one wrong step can easily lead to <u>extreme chaos</u>, where the laws of nature cease to apply!<br>And last but not least, <strong>don't drug your Goblin</strong>, you never know what <u>unexpected</u> results might occur! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AI DISCLAIMER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo